              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esaa neija kugoba, nangu yagobire, orwo murahwera omw'ishwa, buli muntu akairukira omwabo, inye mukansigaho nyenkai. Nawe tindi nyenkai; Tata ali hamoi nanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
